sequenceDiagram
    participant SC as Spring Container
    participant DSC as DataSourceConfiguration
    participant DSP as DataSourceProperties
    participant TRDS as TenantRoutingDataSource
    participant AC as Application Context

    SC->>DSC: instantiate DataSourceConfiguration (properties: DataSourceProperties)
    activate DSC
    
    DSC->>DSC: invoke dataSource method as Bean
    Note right of DSC: Bean annotation triggers method
    activate DSC
    deactivate DSC
    
    DSC->>TRDS: create TenantRoutingDataSource instance
    activate TRDS
    TRDS-->>DSC: New routing data source instance
    deactivate TRDS
    
    DSC->>DSP: get target data sources from properties
    activate DSP
    DSP-->>DSC: Map[String, DataSource] (Tenant-specific data sources)
    deactivate DSP
    
    DSC->>TRDS: setTargetDataSources(datasources)
    activate TRDS
    Note right of TRDS: datasources: Map[Object, Object]
    deactivate TRDS
    
    DSC->>TRDS: setDefaultTargetDataSource(default)
    activate TRDS
    Note right of TRDS: defaultDataSource: DataSource
    deactivate TRDS
    
    DSC->>AC: register bean in application context
    activate AC
    Note right of AC: Bean is now available for injection
    deactivate AC
    
    deactivate DSC